            "explanation": "\\[pK_a=pH-\\log\\left(\\frac{3,98\\times10^{-3}}{9,60\\times10^{-2}}\\right)=2,4-\\log(0,04145)\\approx\\boxed{3,78}.\\]",
            "calculation": "",
